===Verb===
{{ru-verb|заде́рживать|impf|pf=задержа́ть}}

# to [[detain]], to [[hold back]], to [[stop]]
#* {{quote-book|ru|year=1905|author=w:ru:Фёдор Сологуб<t:{{w|Fyodor Sologub}}>
|title=w:ru:Мелкий бес|chapter=XVIII|location=|publisher=|newversion=English translation from|translator2=John Cournos and Richard Aldington|title2=w:en:[[The Petty Demon|The Little Demon]]|location2=New York|publisher2=w:en:Alfred A. Knopf|year2=1916|page2=|pageurl2=
|text=— Извини́те, — сказа́л Гудаевский и показа́л на дверь, — вы́ход здесь, а '''заде́рживать''' не сме́ю.|t=" I beg your pardon," said Goudayevsky and pointed to the door, " that's the way out, and I won't '''detain''' you."}}
# to [[delay]], to [[check]]
# {{topics|ru|Law enforcement}} to [[arrest]], to [[detain]]
# to [[slow down]], to [[retard]], to [[delay]], to [[hamper]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''заде́рживать''' [[дыха́ние]]|to [[hold one's breath]]}}

